---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { url } from "../lib/url";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="页面未找到"
  description="这个坐标上没有东西。返回火箭飞控学习路线图首页。"
  current=""
  noindex
>
  <section class="container center-page">
    <div>
      <div class="code">404</div>
      <h1>这个坐标上没有东西。</h1>
      <p>链接可能已经移动，或者你输入的路径不在当前任务剖面里。</p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content: center;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={url("/")}>返回首页</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={url("/roadmap/")}>查看路线图</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
